      "title": "RSWM Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 90.155 million in funding from Lnj Textiles Advisory Llp",
      "body": "RSWM Limited announced private placement to issue up to 2,470,000 convertible warrants at an issue price of INR 36.5 for gross proceeds of INR 90,155,000 on April 9, 2026. The transaction includes participation from LNJ Textiles Advisory LLP for 2,470,000 warrants at a post issue shareholding of 4.98 %. Each Warrant is convertible into One equity share and the conversion can be exercised at a exercise price of INR 109.5 at any time within a period of 18 months from the date of allotment of warrants, in one or more tranches, as the case may be and on such other terms and conditions as applicable. Option for conversion of warrants shall be available upon payment of full price of warrant before such exercise of option. The transaction is approved by board of directors of the company and is Su",
