      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.50 (up from ₹1.96 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹11.0b (down 7.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹23.8m (up ₹116.1m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.2% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 123 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
